135	  // §16.2): `manual`, so the tick never puts it on a calendar — an item exists
136	  // only because an issue was marked. Its precondition IS the security check, and
137	  // it declares no code-work at all, so a request goes issue → item → agent with
138	  // nothing in between to carry a payload.
139	  registry.set(REQUEST_TASK, {
140	    id: REQUEST_TASK,
141	    frequency: 'manual',
142	    agentMinutes: 45,
143	    ceiling: 'open-pr',
144	    deliversOpenPr: () => true,           // every successful run leaves a PR to review
145	    // Evaluated at pickup like every other precondition, and — the one addition
